# Delivery pipeline

Messages that fail three delivery attempts are parked for 24 hours so an operator can inspect them. The retry budget of three keeps a poison message from blocking healthy traffic, and the 24 hour hold matches our on-call handover window.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  A[Producer] --> B[Queue] --> C[Consumer]
  B --> D[Dead letter queue]
```

Capacity is sized for 5,000 messages per second, with a hard cap of 8,000 before the broker sheds load.
